{"id":"7325f859473bf017","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-hornclause.md","title":"Horn clause","display":"df-hornclause — Horn clause","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-hornclause","aliases":["27-df-hornclause"],"display":"df-hornclause — Horn clause","depends_on":["[[27-df-clause]]"],"local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-hornclause"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-hornclause</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hornclause — Horn clause"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74438714e304bba9\" href=\"?note=74438714e304bba9\" title=\"27-df-clause\">27-df-clause</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Clause}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Clause}_n\\)</span> and its uniquely indexed clauses <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_L\">\\(C_L\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74438714e304bba9\" href=\"?note=74438714e304bba9\" title=\"27-df-clause\">27-df-clause</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornClause}_n\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathrm{Clause}_n:|\\mathrm{CLits}(C)\\cap\\{x_i:i\\in[n]\\}|\\le1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HornClause}_n\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathrm{Clause}_n:|\\mathrm{CLits}(C)\\cap\\{x_i:i\\in[n]\\}|\\le1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.3.1，印刷页 279，PDF 第 303 页（从 1 计数）。 这是 AI 中的 Horn CNF 子句约定（至多一个正文字）。原书 Horn function 使用 DNF 约定：Horn DNF 的补函数才是相应 Horn CNF；不得把两种函数方向混同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"74438714e304bba9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-clause]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"74438714e304bba9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Clause}_n$ and its uniquely indexed clauses $C_L$ are as in [[27-df-clause]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Clause}_n","display":false},{"tex":"C_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornClause}_n\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathrm{Clause}_n:|\\mathrm{CLits}(C)\\cap\\{x_i:i\\in[n]\\}|\\le1\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1011,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-229","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-hornclause|df-hornclause — Horn clause]]"},{"id":"fc6ee0d11ecfb0f6","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornClause}_n$、$T_L$、$\\mathrm{CLits}$、$\\mathrm{Dual}_n$ 分别见 [[27-df-hornclause]]、[[27-df-term]]、[[27-df-clause]]、[[27-df-dual]]。"},{"id":"c841e9e05634a859","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$, $\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{HornClause}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]], [[27-df-horndnf]] and [[27-df-hornclause]]."},{"id":"7335041040d1b313","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornClause}_n$ and $\\mathbf P$ are defined in [[27-df-hornclause]] and [[27-df-classP]]."}],"outgoing":["74438714e304bba9","5d10aed668d85817"]}